  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Cook macaroni according to package instructions until al dente. Drain and set aside.",
    "In a large saucepan, heat olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Stir in temper, cumin, cinnamon, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add cooked macaroni to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the macaroni mixture to a baking dish.",
    "Top with chopped almonds and drizzle with pistachio oil.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15-20 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and crispy.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
